Hi Giannina,

I would move your lgam prior statement out of the likelihood, to something like this:

for (g in 1:ngroup){
lgam[g] ~ dnorm(0,0.01)T(-1,1)
}

where ngroup is the number groups. Same for leps. Otherwise you keep trying to redefine this prior for each member of the group, and that's throwing the error.

Hope this helps,
Adrian

